Evan,

This is something that is possible with a service like namecheap. However, you will need to use a URL redirect <https://www.namecheap.com/support/knowledgebase/article.aspx/385/77/how-do-i-setup-url-forwarding-for-a-domain> rather then a CNAME. Using a CNAME to white label applications will be supported in the "Pro" tier for ShinyApps.

Thanks
-Andy

