Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

You shouldn't need more than one process just to deal with the actions of more than one user. See this article for the basic idea on how to distinguish between global data and per connection data:
http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/scoping.html

If that doesn't help feel free to reply back with more details on your scenario.

